    "rich_text_jngJQR": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Wt7yU7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Awaken the Ancient Light Body Within",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_ziF69K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Join visionary author, mythologist, and mystic explorer <a href=\"https://www.gaia.com/person/william-henry\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">William Henry</span></a> on a once-in-a-lifetime pilgrimage through the sacred sites of Ancient Egypt, the legendary land of the gods, star beings, and divine ascension. This is more than a tour. It is an activation journey and a living encounter with ancient wisdom, preserved in temples, tombs, and the eternal stones shaped by the original Starwalkers.</p><p>Something extraordinary is unfolding in Egypt. Almost daily, new discoveries and new possibilities emerge, stirring long-buried memories of humanity’s higher origins. From the Giza Plateau to the Valley of the Kings, revelations abound. Ancient civilizations, stargates, and transformation are no longer myths of the past but living realities coming back into focus. This is the realm of William’s lifelong work and expertise.</p><p>On this intimate journey, limited to just 32 participants, you will walk the path of the initiates themselves. From the Great Pyramid of Giza to the Temple of Isis at Philae, from Luxor and Karnak to the Valley of the Kings, you will be guided by William’s original insights into ancient Egyptian sacred technologies, Starwalker symbolism, and the timeless mysteries of ascension.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Wt7yU7",
        "text_ziF69K"
      ],
