      "blocks": {
        "dropdown_MpQ7eL": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What’s Included",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li><strong>Private access to the Great Pyramid & Paws of the Sphinx -</strong> Meditate in the King’s Chamber and experience this powerful ascension site.</li><li><strong>Grand Egyptian Museum</strong> - Guided viewing through William Henry’s expert lens.</li><li><strong>Sacred Temple Visits -</strong> Luxor, Karnak, Dendera (Divine Feminine mysteries), and the Temple of Horus at Edfu, exploring Starwalker teachings and ancient ascension symbolism.</li><li><strong>Private Nile Sailing</strong> - Cruise aboard the <em>Sanctuary Sun Boat III</em> through Egypt’s timeless landscapes.</li><li><strong>Daily Sacred Teachings - </strong>Mystical teachings and historical presentations from William Henry, who has led over 30 Egypt tours.</li><li><strong>Conscious Community</strong> - Travel with a small group of like-minded seekers.</li><li><strong>Luxury Experience - </strong>Five-star hotels, a private luxury vessel, and exceptional Abercrombie & Kent (A&K) service.</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_ajAxaD": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What’s Not Included",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Private access inside the Great Pyramid and Paws of the Sphinx – Meditate in the King’s Chamber and feel the transformative power of this amazing ascension instrument.</li><li>Airfare from your country, and back to your country.</li><li>Entry visa to Egypt, which will cost approximately $25 USD per person.</li><li>Passport fees or charges (if any).</li><li>Travel Insurance (Cancellation and Medical Insurance).</li><li>Personal expenses, such as laundry service, mini bar charges, drinks with meals, and health club fees, etc.</li><li>Gratuities: $450 per person tipping for bus drivers, tour guides, hotel staff, restaurant staff, etc.</li><li>Extra meals not included in itinerary.</li><li>NOTE: Alcoholic beverages with meals are NOT included.</li><li>Emergency evacuation.</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_zxUc4t": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Reservation & Payment",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li><strong>$5,000 non-refundable deposit</strong> required at booking.</li><li>Reservation is confirmed upon receipt of payment.</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_F3F9mP": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Cancellation & Refund Policy",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>All payments are <strong>non-refundable</strong>. If you choose to cancel your participation in this tour, we will not refund any deposits or subsequent payments, regardless of circumstances.</li><li>Travel insurance is <strong>strongly recommended </strong>in case of emergencies or unforeseen circumstances that may arise at your end.</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_rzQq4A": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Travel Insurance",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We highly recommend that all participants obtain travel insurance. Travel Insured International offers insurance for trip cost, trip cancellation & interruption, and pays for loss due to unforeseen circumstances, death, injury, or illness to you or a member of your family. It also includes coverage for missed connections due to weather, pays for lost deposits due to the financial default of the airline, the tour operator, or the cruise line. It pays for baggage delays, travel delays, medical expenses, and emergency assistance.</p><p>Participants are responsible for securing their own travel insurance. Coverage should include trip cancellation or interruption, medical expenses, missed connections, and unforeseen emergencies. Be sure that you are getting coverage that includes a refund if the Host of the retreat is unavailable to attend, if you wish to apply that option.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_Ypd9Wp": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Itinerary Changes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This Itinerary is subject to changes to adapt to possible alterations in domestic flight times or other unforeseen circumstances. The content will remain the same, barring any unanticipated complications, and will include many delightful “extras” and surprises.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_aMTFHh": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Waiver of Responsibility",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>By signing up for the Tour, you agree to our Terms, Deposit Conditions, and Waiver.</p><p>William Henry has worked diligently to make all the arrangements for our journey together in Egypt. However, William Henry will not be held liable for delays, theft, damage, injury, or any other irregularities that may occur during the journey. We will not be held liable for any changes or delays in airline schedules or missed connections; injury, loss, or damage to persons or property; additional expenses resulting from changes in exchange rates, tariffs, or itinerary; any transportation issues or problems with vehicles utilized on the tour; additional expenses incurred due to illness, weather conditions, protests, war, terrorism, quarantine, or other causes; and losses due to cancellations not subject to our Terms and Conditions.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#513589",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
